From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Toxpox <toxpox@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:45:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: ti: build the T3 Gemstone O1 DTBs

The board DTS is not upstream yet, so Armbian carries the whole file in
patch/kernel/archive/k3-6.18/dt/ and copies it in through dts-directories.
Copying alone never builds the sources, so add the Makefile entries for the
base DTB and the optional PCIe Gen3 opt-in overlay.

The K3 Makefile mixes .dtb and .dtbo targets under one config variable, which
the auto-patch-dt-makefile helper cannot reproduce, hence the explicit patch.

Signed-off-by: Toxpox <toxpox@outlook.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile
@@ -218,6 +218,8 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-j721s2-evm-audio.dtbo
 
 # Boards with J722s SoC
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-beagley-ai.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-t3-gem-o1.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-t3-gem-o1-pcie-link-speed-3.dtbo
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-j722s-evm.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-j722s-evm-csi2-quad-rpi-cam-imx219.dtbo
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-j722s-evm-csi2-quad-tevi-ov5640.dtbo
-- 
Armbian
